{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e09-scene-17",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "科学工作法与谈心  (A Crash Course in Work-Life Balance)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At lunchtime, Kaiwen marches into Chun Yuqiao's office with boiled cauliflower and an elaborate excuse about a work-life training course paid for by the chairwoman. Listen to their Mandarin exchange.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这不是午休吗？我一直在这儿等你，想跟你谈谈心。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "谈谈心？你三大阻力都搬开了，有那么闲吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "工作压力大，那就更得注意劳逸结合嘛。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "真是没长进，你还不如布小谷呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "前两天董事长花钱给我报了一个科学工作法的短期培训，让我管理你的作息。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "针对你这种情况，应该重视家庭生活、开展体育运动、养殖宠物、种花种草。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "很显然这些对你都没什么用，所以只剩下最后一条：朋友谈心。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "给你一分钟，把你这废话说完。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "两个大老爷们，那只能聊姑娘了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "滚！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你注意态度，面对现实，跟姑娘打交道这项你是不是短板？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我不是跟你吹，除了杏子那关我过不了，她还总踢我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这方面的事，除了我，你还有别的哥们能聊吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "马上出去！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这不是午休吗？我一直在这儿等你，想跟你谈谈心。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is it not lunch break? I have been waiting right here to have a heart-to-heart chat with you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "谈谈心？你三大阻力都搬开了，有那么闲吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A heart-to-heart? Have you cleared away all three obstacles already that you have such free time?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "工作压力大，那就更得注意劳逸结合嘛。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When work pressure is heavy, it is all the more important to balance work and rest.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "真是没长进，你还不如布小谷呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Zero progress—you are not even as driven as Bu Xiaogu.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "前两天董事长花钱给我报了一个科学工作法的短期培训，让我管理你的作息。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Two days ago the chairwoman paid for me to take a short course in scientific work habits so I can manage your schedule.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "针对你这种情况，应该重视家庭生活、开展体育运动、养殖宠物、种花种草。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'For someone in your case, you ought to value family life, play sports, keep pets, and grow flowers.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "很显然这些对你都没什么用，所以只剩下最后一条：朋友谈心。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Obviously none of those work for you, leaving only the last option: chatting with a friend.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "给你一分钟，把你这废话说完。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You get one minute to finish spouting this nonsense.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "两个大老爷们，那只能聊姑娘了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When two grown men chat, the only topic left is women.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "滚！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Get out!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你注意态度，面对现实，跟姑娘打交道这项你是不是短板？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Watch your attitude and face reality—when it comes to dealing with women, is that not your weak spot?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我不是跟你吹，除了杏子那关我过不了，她还总踢我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Not to brag, apart from never getting past Xingzi—who is always kicking me—I handle everything else.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这方面的事，除了我，你还有别的哥们能聊吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'On matters like this, besides me, do you even have another buddy you can talk to?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "马上出去！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Out, right now!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
